    "items": [
     {
      "type": "mainHeadline",
      "text": "Five Facts About Lufthansa Allegris That Will Surprise You",
      "variant": "HEADING_XL",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/discover-allegris/allegris-essentials_title",
      "isBold": true
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>15. September 2026 | 2 min read | Lufthansa Editorial Team</b>",
      "size": "SMALL",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/discover-allegris/allegris-essentials_info"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>From comfortable mattresses to unique design: discover five amazing facts about Lufthansa Allegris, the new premium experience on long-haul routes.</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/discover-allegris/allegris-essentials_description_0"
     },
     {
      "type": "spacer",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/discover-allegris/allegris-essentials_separator"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Supported Side Position</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/discover-allegris/allegris-essentials_paragraph_0"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "Sleeping like you would at home? Almost. The mattresses in Lufthansa Allegris Business and First Class feature a special “shoulder sink-in” function, which allows the shoulder to gently sink into the mattress and relieves pressure on the neck and spine – especially for side sleepers. In Business Class, the seat also transforms into a bed that's 2.20 meters long (7 feet 2 inches). Basketball star Dirk Nowitzki, who is 2.12 meters (6 feet 11 inches) tall, has already put the comfort to the test.",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/discover-allegris/allegris-essentials_paragraph_1"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Let There Be Light</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/discover-allegris/allegris-essentials_paragraph_2"
     },
     {
      "type": "image",
      "id": "/content/mobile/lh/en/articles/discover-allegris/allegris-essentials/jcr:content/articlecontentfragment/par2/image",
      "url": "https://www.lufthansa.com/content/dam/lh/article-images/mobile-app/discover-allegris/five-facts-about-lufthansa-allegris-that-will-surprise-you/lh_app_allegris_illustration1_sylvia-neuner_1920x1080.jpg.transform/lh-dcep-transform-width-1440/img.jpg",
      "contentDescription": "Illustration of a sleeping person with a dream bubble in the shape of the sun"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "Less jet lag after a long-haul flight? An intelligent lighting system from jetlite helps make it possible. Different light scenarios prepare the body for the new time zone: warm white light mimics the sunset and helps passengers relax, while cool white light creates an energizing start to the day.",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/discover-allegris/allegris-essentials_paragraph_3"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Going the Distance for Comfort</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/discover-allegris/allegris-essentials_paragraph_4"
     },
     {
      "type": "image",
      "id": "/content/mobile/lh/en/articles/discover-allegris/allegris-essentials/jcr:content/articlecontentfragment/par4/image_copy",
      "url": "https://www.lufthansa.com/content/dam/lh/article-images/mobile-app/discover-allegris/five-facts-about-lufthansa-allegris-that-will-surprise-you/lh_app_allegris_illustration2_sylvia-neuner_1920x1080.jpg.transform/lh-dcep-transform-width-1440/img.jpg",
      "contentDescription": "Illustration of the sun, the earth, and an airplane seat; lines in between represent the respective distance"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "Comfort comes at a price – and Lufthansa is spending big: around €3 billion is being invested in improving products and services. More than 31,600 new Lufthansa Allegris seats are joining the fleet. If they all took a journey together, they would cover an incredible 1.26 trillion kilometers (783 billion miles) – while the distance from the Earth to the sun is “only” 150 million kilometers (93 million miles).",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/discover-allegris/allegris-essentials_paragraph_5"
     },
     {
      "type": "spacer",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "id": "/content/mobile/lh/en/articles/discover-allegris/allegris-essentials/jcr:content/articlecontentfragment/par5/separator_copy_copy_"
